Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.05,1:00:53.79,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}呐…你幸福吗？…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.05,1:00:53.79,菊地真-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}ねぇ⋯幸せ？⋯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.42,1:00:56.20,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}好想见你…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.42,1:00:56.20,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}逢いたい⋯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.20,1:01:01.74,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}连短信甚至手机
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.20,1:01:01.74,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}メールも携帯も
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.74,1:01:10.27,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}没有响应  tears  不禁开始痛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.74,1:01:10.27,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}鳴らない　tears　泣いてるよ
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.09,1:01:05.07,pop-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}why
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.59,1:01:16.69,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}哪怕只有一秒也好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.59,1:01:16.69,菊地真-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}一秒だけでもいい
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.55,1:01:24.01,萩原雪歩-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}若如今能感觉到你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.55,1:01:24.01,萩原雪歩-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}君を今　感じたら
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.01,1:01:28.27,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}此刻便是永恒…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.01,1:01:28.27,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}ずっと⋯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:21.85,萩原雪歩-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}Moonlight  真是美丽啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:21.85,萩原雪歩-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}Moonlight　綺麗だね
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.59,1:02:28.69,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}或许你也  能够有所体会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.59,1:02:28.69,菊地真-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}君にも　届いてるかな？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.69,1:02:35.28,萩原雪歩-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}假如发现流星飞过的话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.69,1:02:35.28,萩原雪歩-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}もし流れ星見つけたら
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.76,1:02:40.90,萩原雪歩-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}愿望仅有一个…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.76,1:02:40.90,萩原雪歩-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}ひとつだけ⋯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.13,1:02:42.91,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}渴望见你…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.13,1:02:42.91,菊地真-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}逢いたい⋯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.91,1:02:48.43,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}将更多心意
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.91,1:02:48.43,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}もっと心が
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.67,1:02:56.79,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}赠与你  呐  如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.67,1:02:56.79,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}君へと　ねぇ　送れたら
