Comment: 0,1:36:16.00,1:36:17.00,Title,,0,0,0,,Story
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.38,1:36:28.80,both-MC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}致我最珍视的你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.18,1:36:33.78,菊地真-MC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}别来无恙
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.76,1:36:38.21,菊地真-MC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}浪花拂去了浅浅的回忆
